{"id":"vod_sn_38752","vodId":"38752","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"上课小动作","name_cn":"上课小动作","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9246d96563ac8c5deb9c20d1fb5d4ecd.jpg"},"summary":"坐在班级最后一排的横井（花泽香菜 配音），她的邻座关同学（下野纮 配音）是个怪咖，他总是在上课时开小差——以令人叹为观止的方式玩着各种神乎其技的小游戏，从多诺米骨牌、将棋、围棋到桌上高尔夫，甚至是动手打磨改造桌子。关同学的这些上课小动作已经完全超出了“小动作”的范畴，以至于个性认真的横井无法对他的行为视而不见，尽管她想认真听课，可是每次都会不由自主地被关同学玩的小游戏吸引着。她常常用眼神或者低声开口阻止关同学，因此不时被老师点名批评。然而关同学我行我素，还练就了在老师发觉前就能销毁证据的拿手好戏。　　本动画以每集8分钟的长度，展现了关同学花样百出的“小动作“，加上横井的吐槽，这对邻座带给观众轻松爆笑的课上小故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ACpNPRWLbv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QcaBHg4St11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vJ8QyU6E1f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5VxKC42UcC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2ahUv7xipe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bqJ4pA4NCm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r8t3E9stLd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WAszPMZuUi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vufGjBRXjW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QwDxJ3n4JJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B05RCBpyaj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FmATqhA8hP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZKW8huv8QW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7zymKvfZ4i1/video/ind